@{
    NopHtml.AddTitleParts("Tracking Information for Airless, Pressure Washer and Air Compressor products");
    NopHtml.AddMetaDescriptionParts("Tracking of airless paint sprayers, air compressors, pressure washers, accessories, parts. The painting equipment tracking page.");
}

<div class="row">
    <div class="col-sm-12">
        <h1>Tracking</h1>
        <p>Nearly everything we ship is sent via UPS. The exceptions are; heavy equipment, crated items, items over 150 lbs., and some light-weight items such as single; spray tips, gun filters and other small parts.</p>
        <span class="h4">Also see</span>
        <ul class="list-unstyled">
            <li><a href="@Url.Action("shipping", "HomePC")">Shipping Info</a></li>
        </ul>
        <p>You can track your packages by tracking number or by order number.</p>
        <p>Transit times vary. These variables include; carrier, destination, package weight, package size and item types (some items must go via ground do to FAA regulations).</p>
        <h4>UPS Tracking</h4>
        <p><a href="https://www.ups.com/us/en/Home.page">ups.com</a></p>
        <h4>By Order Number</h4>
        <p>Log into your account <a href="~/login">here.</a></p>
        <img alt="UPS Ground service time map" src="~/images/ups-map.png">

        @* <p>Enter either your tracking number in the "By Tracking Number" box or your Portland Compressor online order number in the "By Order Number" box and use the "Track It" button.</p> *@
